--               2000...0005 Aarav Sharma (STUDENT)      2000...0006 Riya Patel (STUDENT, junior)
--   courses     3000...0001 CS304  3000...0002 DES201  3000...0003 CS204-2024
--   offerings   4000...0001 CS304-A  4000...0002 DES201-A  4000...0003 CS204-2024
--   chunks      50000000-0000-0000-000<course>-000000000<unit><seq>  e.g. CS304 U1C2 = 50000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000102
